    aboHowtoTitle:'How to use the Subscription Calculator', aboHowtoDesc:'Get a full overview of your subscription costs',
    aboHowtoRows:[['— HOW TO USE THE CALCULATOR —','Get an overview of what you pay in subscriptions'],['1. Add your subscriptions','Choose from the list or type your own. Prices are auto-filled with typical Norwegian prices, but you can adjust.'],['2. Click Calculate','You see total cost per month, per year and per day — plus a perspective box putting the amount in context.'],['3. Evaluate each subscription','Do you actually use all services? Many pay for things they rarely use.'],['— GOOD TO KNOW —',''],['Subscription creep','Small amounts like 99 kr/mo feel harmless, but 10 such subscriptions are almost 12,000 kr per year.'],['Share where you can','Family and friend plans are often much cheaper per person. Spotify Family, Netflix Standard etc.'],['Clean up regularly','Set a reminder every 3 months: Go through your bank statement and look for subscriptions you forgot about.']],
