    npvHeroTitle: 'NPV / IRR',
    npvHeroLead: 'Profitability analysis: is the investment worth it? Enter the investment amount, your required rate of return and expected income for the next 5 years — and the calculator will compute net present value (NPV), internal rate of return (IRR), payback period and profitability per krone. Everything runs locally in your browser.',
