    npvRIrr: 'IRR',
    npvInfoBox: 'NPV discounts future cash flows to today\'s value using the required rate of return. Positive NPV = the investment yields more than your required return. IRR is the rate that makes NPV = 0 — compare with your required return to see if the project creates value.',
