    regnskapMvaH1Html: '<em>VAT</em> return',
    regnskapMvaLead: 'Calculate VAT payable or refundable for your period. Supports 25 %, 15 %, 12 % and 0 % rates. 6 two-month periods per year, deadline 1 month + 10 days after period end. Form RF-0002 to the Tax Authority. Everything runs locally in the browser.',
