    skattUttakHowtoR1Title: 'Choose business type',
    skattUttakHowtoR1Desc: 'ENK = you are taxed directly. AS = both company and shareholder are taxed (two levels).',
    skattUttakHowtoR2Title: 'Market value vs tax value',
