    skattUttakInfoEnkRow3: '+ Bracket tax (if personal income)',
    skattUttakInfoEnkCond: 'Condition: cost price wholly/partly deducted (§ 5-2(1))',
    skattUttakInfoAsLbl: 'Limited company (AS)',
    skattUttakInfoAsRow1: 'Level 1: <b>Corporate tax 22 %</b>',
    skattUttakInfoAsRow2: 'Level 2: <b>Dividend tax ~37.84 %</b>',
    skattUttakInfoAsRow3: 'Gross-up: <b>×1.72</b>',
    skattUttakInfoAsCond: 'Withdrawal is deemed a dividend for the shareholder',
    skattUttakInfoExcLead: '<b>Exceptions and special rules:</b>',
    skattUttakInfoExc1: '<b>ENK condition (§ 5-2(1)):</b> Withdrawal taxation applies only where the cost price has been wholly or partly deducted',
    skattUttakInfoExc2: '<b>Business transfer (§ 9-7(4)):</b> Exception for gift where the recipient takes over the business and continues operations',
    skattUttakInfoExc3: '<b>Participation exemption (§ 2-38):</b> A company owning shares in another company — withdrawal of such shares may be tax-free at company level',
    skattUttakInfoExc4: '<b>Group relationships:</b> On withdrawal from a subsidiary to the shareholder, it is the subsidiary that is subject to withdrawal taxation',
    skattUttakInfoExc5: '<b>Private use of company assets:</b> Ongoing use (e.g. housing, boat, car) is taxed as a dividend for the shareholder under the shareholder model',
    skattUttakInfoSource: 'Source: Tax Act § 5-2, § 5-3 and ch. 9 (act-1999-03-26-14). The calculator is indicative — consult an auditor for specific assessments.',
    skattUttakInfoDisclaimer: 'Simplified calculation. Bracket tax 2026: bracket 1 (1.7 %), 2 (4.0 %), 3 (13.7 %), 4 (16.8 %), 5 (17.8 %). National insurance with lower threshold 99 650 kr and phase-in rule 25 %.',
