"28–35 % er vanlig for varmmat i restaurant. Drikke ligger ofte lavere. Lav food cost gir mer dekningsbidrag per rett, men prisen må fortsatt oppleves riktig for gjesten.":"28–35 % is normal for hot food in a restaurant. Drinks are often lower. A low food cost gives more contribution margin per dish, but the price still has to feel right to the guest.",
"28–35 % er vanlig i restaurant. Del råvarekosten på food cost-andelen for å få salgsprisen eks. mva.":"28–35 % is normal in a restaurant. Divide the ingredient cost by the food cost share to get the sale price excl. VAT.",
