"Arbeidsgiveravgift er kostnaden for arbeidsgiver — her ser du hva den ansatte faktisk får utbetalt etter skatt.":"The employer's national insurance contribution is the employer's cost — here you see what the employee actually gets paid after tax.",
"Arbeidsgiveravgift innbetales i 2-månedlige terminer, altså seks ganger årlig. Kalkulatoren viser årskostnaden, men du fordeler den utover året.":"The employer's national insurance contribution is paid in 2-month periods, that is six times a year. The calculator shows the annual cost, but you spread it across the year.",
"Arbeidsgiveravgift innbetales seks ganger i året, i 2-månedlige terminer. Kalkulatoren viser den samlede årskostnaden.":"The employer's national insurance contribution is paid six times a year, in 2-month periods. The calculator shows the total annual cost.",
"Arbeidsgiveravgift og pensjonskostnad":"Employer's national insurance contribution (AGA) and pension cost",
