"Hver arbeids-rad ganger antall timer med timeprisen. Alle radene legges sammen til arbeid total.":"Each labour row multiplies the number of hours by the hourly rate. All the rows are added up to the labour total.",
"Hver deltaker hefter for":"Each partner is liable for",
