"Lånet betales ned hver måned, så ett år er tolv terminer. Et lån over 20 år gir 240 betalinger. Kalkulatoren regner alltid med månedlige terminer.":"The loan is repaid every month, so one year is twelve instalments. A loan over 20 years gives 240 payments. The calculator always assumes monthly instalments.",
"Lånet betales ned med like store terminbeløp hver måned over nedbetalingstiden (standard 25 år). I starten er mest renter, mot slutten mest avdrag.":"The loan is paid down with equal instalments every month over the repayment period (default 25 years). At the start it is mostly interest, towards the end mostly principal repayment.",
