"Margin måles mot salgspris, markup mot kostpris — to ulike prosenter for samme fortjeneste.":"Margin is measured against the selling price, markup against the cost price — two different percentages for the same profit.",
"Margin måles mot salgsprisen, markup mot kostprisen. Med kostpris 500 og salgspris 800 får du 37,5 % margin, men 60 % markup. Samme fortjeneste, to forskjellige prosenter — sjekk alltid hvilken et tilbud snakker om.":"Margin is measured against the selling price, markup against the cost price. With a cost price of 500 and a selling price of 800 you get a 37,5 % margin, but 60 % markup. Same profit, two different percentages — always check which one an offer is talking about.",
"Margin og markup":"Margin and markup",
