"Nåverdien av inntektene delt på investeringen. Over 1,00x betyr at hver investerte krone gir mer enn én krone tilbake i dagens verdi. Akkurat 1,00x betyr at den går i null.":"The present value of the income divided by the investment. Above 1,00x means every krone invested gives back more than one krone in today's value. Exactly 1,00x means it breaks even.",
