"Tilbudet fra ny bank (eller forhandlet rente i samme bank). Sjekk at det er garantert rente, ikke kampanjerente.":"The offer from a new bank (or a negotiated rate at the same bank). Check that it is a guaranteed rate, not a promotional rate.",
